 er of Asian Thought Club.\n\nYour ticket includes:\n• Three soju tasting
 s\n• Korean snack pairings\n• A captivating lecture on the history of 
 soju\n• A cozy introduction to 10 works of Korean Literature\nFor ticket
 s and more information\, please visit\nLuma
