BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tiny Titans: In Conversation with Dara Ojo
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261202T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261202T200000
UID:bm-6768420261202@shop.queenbooks.ca
DESCRIPTION:[Off-site]\nJoin in this evening to celebrate macro photograph
 y and the intricate beauty and ecological importance of insects and spider
 s\, creatures that quietly anchor global biodiversity\, pollination\, and 
 climate resilience.\nMeet Dara Ojo\, an award-winning macro photographer a
 nd conservation storyteller whose work brings the hidden world of arthropo
 ds into vivid relief. Ojo's book\, Tiny Titans : The Silent Keepers of Our
  Ecosystem reveals the fascinating lives of insects\, spiders\, and other 
 small creatures that quietly sustain life on Earth.\nFor tickets and more 
 information\, visit the\nTPL website\n.
LOCATION:North York Library
URL:https://shop.queenbooks.ca/events
X-SOURCE:Queen Books
END:VEVENT
